Package: picsure
Type: Package
Title: R Client for the PIC-SURE API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("PIC-SURE", "Team", email = "pic-sure-team@hms.harvard.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Thin R wrapper over the PIC-SURE Python adapter. Provides functions
    to connect to PIC-SURE networks, search the data dictionary, build nested
    query clauses, run queries, and export results. Python interop is handled
    transparently via reticulate; the required Python environment is provisioned
    automatically on first use.
License: GPL (>= 3) + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    reticulate (>= 1.41)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    mockery,
    covr,
    devtools
Config/testthat/edition: 3
